e_number>,\n        \"message\": \"<what CodeQL found>\",\n        \"severity\": \"<error|warning|note>\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"dataflow_summary\": \"<if dataflow analysis, describe the taint path>\",\n    \"key_insight\": \"<most important finding related to the bug>\",\n    \"fix_suggestions\": [\n      {\n        \"approach\": \"<description of fix approach>\",\n        \"reasoning\": \"<why this approach is promising based on static analysis>\",\n        \"trade_offs\": \"<considerations or trade-offs>\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n  ```\n  If no relevant findings are found, report that honestly.\n\nBe thorough in your identification, mining, analysis, and reasoning. It's fine if your thinking process is lengthy - quality and completeness are more important than brevity. If history provides no useful insights, state that clearly.\n"}
